  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Use of Statistics Norway for Tax for Development in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two-year pre-project to plan for a long-term collaboration. Some of the work that will be explored include 1) work on the business register, 2) training in statistics, 3) national accounts, and 4) macroeconomic modelling. The aim is to develop a long-term cooperation between Statistics Norway and the Ministry of Finance and Ghana Statistical Service to improve the institutions. ability in providing tax policy research.</narrative>
  </description>
